//@version=5
indicator("MSTR BTC Holdings (WiseSatoshi)", overlay=false)

// -----------------------------------------------------------------
// Real cumulative BTC holdings after every disclosed purchase or
// sale, compiled from Strategy's 8-Ks, 10-Qs, and 10-Ks (Aug 11,
// 2020 through Aug 31, 2026). Plotted as a stairstep since holdings
// only change on disclosed dates -- there's no real "in between."
//
// HOW TO UPDATE: whenever Strategy discloses a new purchase or sale
// (weekly 8-K is the usual cadence lately), add ONE new pair of
// lines anywhere in the block below, in the same format:
//     array.push(dDate, timestamp("YYYY-MM-DD"))
//     array.push(dHeld, NEW_CUMULATIVE_TOTAL)
// Order doesn't matter -- the lookup below always finds the most
// recent disclosed date at or before each bar automatically. For a
// sale, just use the new (lower) cumulative total, same as a buy.
// -----------------------------------------------------------------

